                                                "sense_id": "cd6cae9d-f46e-36de-b9e6-f4fd82ad82f9",
                                                "text": "“This pertains to employees in DC, NY, Las Vegas and Orlando. TFG continues to pay chefs and restaurants managers responsible for operating the community kitchens,” the company said."
